&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Watershed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will assess &amp;amp; combine data from Watershed's digital channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own marketing &amp;amp; sales reporting for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cost-per-click, cost-per-lead, &amp;amp; click-through-rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with our R&amp;amp;D team on data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements: experience with &amp;lt;insert framework&amp;gt; and understanding of &amp;amp;quot;big data&amp;amp;quot; systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Salary:&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; $120k &amp;ndash; $180k&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build beautiful UIs with React &amp;amp; TypeScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&amp;quot;italic&amp;quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
